{"data": [{"author_id": "2285724841", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:30:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117489465144877340"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/BVgljy9Pnq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ClariosGlobal/status/2117489465144877340/video/1", "media_key": "7_2117488262990217217", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/BVgljy9Pnq"}]}, "id": "2117489465144877340", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 104, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Another step forward for sodium-ion technology. \n\nTogether with Altris and InoBat, Clarios is advancing sodium-ion technology from cell development toward real-world applications. \n\nAt InoBat’s facility in Slovakia, sodium-ion cells are being produced and prepared for their next https://t.co/BVgljy9Pnq", "url": "https://x.com/ClariosGlobal/status/2117489465144877340"}, {"author_id": "853318060052291584", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117951671703621998"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/aYB9umfS2b", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OwenGregorian/status/2117951671703621998/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117951667308044288", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/aYB9umfS2b"}]}, "id": "2117951671703621998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2057, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Lithium Batteries Could Finally Have a Serious Rival, and It’s Made From Salt | Wonderful Engineering\n\nLithium-ion batteries have dominated electric vehicles and energy storage for years, but a competing technology is beginning to gain commercial momentum. Sodium-ion batteries, https://t.co/aYB9umfS2b", "url": "https://x.com/OwenGregorian/status/2117951671703621998"}, {"author_id": "2111496060262662145", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:05:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117362436055367953"], "entities": {"u