dium Claims (Formula-Free)\nDate: 4 November 2026  Status DisclaimerThis addendum records", "url": "https://x.com/Tlockty/status/2118066755981717613"}, {"author_id": "2107130763301056512", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:24:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117684273524383759"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 231, "start": 212, "tag": "SodiumIonBatteries"}, {"end": 243, "start": 232, "tag": "OGAnalysis"}], "urls": [{"description": "Hard Carbon Anode Materials for Sodium-Ion Batteries Market reaches USD 92 million in 2026 and is projected to grow USD 874 million by 2034.", "display_url": "oganalysis.com/industry-repor…", "end": 210, "expanded_url": "https://www.oganalysis.com/industry-reports/hard-carbon-anode-materials-for-sodiumion-batteries-market", "images": [{"height": 54, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117684273767690241/nS-tDnP_?format=png&name=orig", "width": 54}, {"height": 54, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117684273767690241/nS-tDnP_?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 54}], "start": 187, "status": 200, "title": "Hard Carbon Anode Materials for Sodium-Ion Batteries Market Size, Share, Growth Insights 2026-2034", "unwound_url": "https://www.oganalysis.com/industry-reports/hard-carbon-anode-materials-for-sodiumion-batteries-market", "url": "https://t.co/6mq5Oh2Sqk"}]}, "id": "2117684273524383759", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔋 Hard Carbon Anode Materials for Sodium-Ion Batteries Market: USD 92M in 2026 → USD 874M by 2034, growing at 32.5% CAGR!\n\nRising sodium-ion battery adoption, grid-scale energy storage\n🔗 https://t.co/6mq5Oh2Sqk\n\n#SodiumIonBatteries #OGAnalysis", "url": "https://x.com/vincentj0909/status/2117684273524383759"}, {"author_id": "1607652420884078592", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117655544244912611"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KUe7nLYZ0Q", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/startup__pedia/status/2117655544244912611/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117601386271768576", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/KUe7nLYZ0Q"}]}, "id": "2117655544244912611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Roorkee-based energy storage startup, IndiEnergy, is developing sodium-ion batteries and hard-carbon anode materials using agricultural waste.\n\nThe startup converts agricultural biomass, including rice straw and sugarcane bagasse, into BioBlack, a hard-carbon material used as https://t.co/KUe7nLYZ0Q", "url": "https://x.com/startup__pedia/status/2117655544244912611"}, {"author_id": "1547272016", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:24:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117699435828551923"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 55, "start": 52, "tag": "BE"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/J38QCnrnEV", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Abbyxvx87/status/2117699435828551923/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117698987059003392", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/J38QCnrnEV"}]}, "id": "2117699435828551923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11461, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "Barclays upgraded Bloom Energy to Overweight today.\n$BE has been strong.\nI think theres an industry shift worth watching behind it.\n\nOn Oct 22 BE reported Q3 revenue up 138.1% year over year. Put that next to Texas power policy and it gets more interesting. Texas SB 6 took effect https://t.co/J38QCnrnEV", "url": "https://x.com/Abbyxvx87/status/2117699435828551923"}, {"author_id": "1280738015300579328", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:10:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117620548587192714"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 237, "start": 225, "tag": "DataCenters"}], "mentions": [{"end": 224, "id": "817386", "start": 215, "username": "Techmeme"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Techmeme/statu…", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Techmeme/status/2117590315796451736", "start": 238, "url": "https://t.co/7LkcaYtKVw"}]}, "id": "2117620548587192714", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117590315796451736", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Data center developers are repurposing retired jet engines as aeroderivative natural gas turbines, cutting power deployment timelines to ~2 years and bypassing 5-to-10-year utility grid interconnection queues.\n\nvia @Techmeme #DataCenters\nhttps://t.co/7LkcaYtKVw", "url": "https://x.com/VisiveAI/status/2117620548587192714"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:42:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117628384234615142"], "id": "2117628384234615142", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gartner: data center power up 26% this year. Grid interconnection runs 4+ years. You can't build AI infrastructure on that timeline. Off-grid dedicated power is what actually moves. What's the path for AI campus development this decade?", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2117628384234615142"}, {"author_id": "1474031294266978305", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:05:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118026932751413293"], "id": "2118026932751413293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grid Interconnection Capacity Management 🌐\n\nManaging interconnection limits prevents mining facilities from placing excessive demand on shared electrical infrastructure.", "url": "https://x.com/wainright_kevin/status/2118026932751413293"}, {"author_id": "1266759196197810176", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:07:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117981979891442031"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "IREN"}]}, "id": "2117981979891442031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$IREN IREN has the critical grid interconnection and power delivery infrastructure secured or energized for both Childress and Sweetwater, tax incentives in place, and active construction. They are now more valuable.", "url": "https://x.com/wonder_dare/status/2117981979891442031"}, {"author_id": "1434237661728882694", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:32:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118033549987070083"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/GaffarYakinca/…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GaffarYakinca/status/2108530724697477438", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/W7XhFaclq2"}]}, "id": "2118033549987070083", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 230, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108530724697477438", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is only but ONE reason my team is designing, patenting, and developing a premium US made SODIUM Ion battery solution. The sheer amount of forced Lithium Ion battery replacement over the next 10 years is unfathomable.  Meanwhile Sodium-ion batteries have tremendous advantages https://t.co/W7XhFaclq2", "url": "https://x.com/PixelRainbowNFT/status/2118033549987070083"}, {"author_id": "2104925784851038208", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118049388165730653"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 232, "start": 218, "tag": "EnergyStorage"}, {"end": 243, "start": 233, "tag": "PowerGrid"}], "mentions": [{"end": 15, "id": "976077548697374720", "start": 0, "username": "EnergyVaultInc"}], "urls": [{"description": "Long Duration Energy Storage 2026 reports Energy Vault’s largest contract, a 1.25 GW build starting in Texas with US500milliontoUS600 million forecast.", "display_url": "…ng-duration-energy-storage-summit.com/news/energy-va…", "end": 211, "expanded_url": "https://www.usa.long-duration-energy-storage-summit.com/news/energy-vaults-ai-power-deal-takes-the-off-grid-route", "images": [{"height": 444, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118049436735836161/cyHScHRU?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 788}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118049436735836161/cyHScHRU?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 188, "status": 200, "title": "Long Duration Energy Storage 2026 | Off Grid AI Power Deal", "unwound_url": "https://www.usa.long-duration-energy-storage-summit.com/news/energy-vaults-ai-power-deal-takes-the-off-grid-route", "url": "https://t.co/en8glviolf"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Zr4sBBTX8i", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IQ_hub_events/status/2118049388165730653/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117978004244905984", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/Zr4sBBTX8i"}]}, "id": "2118049388165730653", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@EnergyVaultInc's 1.25 GW Texas AI-power deal combines BESS, grid-forming power conversion and controls to bring hyperscale compute online without waiting for grid interconnection.\n\nRead: https://t.co/en8glviolf\n.\n.\n.\n#EnergyStorage #PowerGrid https://t.co/Zr4sBBTX8i", "url": "https://x.com/IQ_hub_events/status/2118049388165730653"}, {"author_id": "1574099782150524928", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:20:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118015571426001401"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/SouthernValue9…", "end": 215, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/SouthernValue95/status/2117815210694283293", "start": 192, "url": "https://t.co/nbQZ052VOP"}]}, "id": "2118015571426001401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117815210694283293", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Exactly. Land and chips are the easy part ...grid interconnection is the gate. Those with permitted + powered capacity become the landlords of the AI economy. Rent seeking in its purest form. https://t.co/nbQZ052VOP", "url": "https://x.com/connord_econ/status/2118015571426001401"}, {"author_id": "1744967465120194560", "created_at": "2026-11-03T10:17:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117561848879079429"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 263, "start": 247, "tag": "EnergyCentralPH"}], "urls": [{"description": "The Philippines is backing faster ASEAN grid development as countries tackle infrastructure and regulatory barriers to cross-border electricity trading.", "display_url": "energycentralph.info/ph-push-faster…", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://energycentralph.info/ph-push-faster-asean-power-grid-energy-crises/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117561849629859840/I3suFddB?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117561849629859840/I3suFddB?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 222, "status": 200, "title": "Philippines Pushes Faster ASEAN Power Grid To Shield Region From Energy Crises - Energy Central PH", "unwound_url": "https://energycentralph.info/ph-push-faster-asean-power-grid-energy-crises/", "url": "https://t.co/0OuQPKCtXR"}]}, "id": "2117561848879079429", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The DOE is accelerating push for the four-nation ASEAN Power Grid interconnection linking Brunei, Indonesia, Malaysia, and the Philippines to bolster regional energy security and mitigate severe fossil fuel import shocks.\nhttps://t.co/0OuQPKCtXR\n\n#EnergyCentralPH", "url": "https://x.com/energycentralph/status/2117561848879079429"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:33:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117596024982147186"], "id": "2117596024982147186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Every AI data center is a power problem first.\n\nThe compute roadmap is public. The power solution usually isn't.\n\nMost projects stall waiting on grid interconnection. Off-grid dedicated power is how you skip the queue and control your timeline.", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2117596024982147186"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:05:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117996786212122860"], "id": "2117996786212122860", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grid interconnection averages 7 years. AI moves faster.\n\nThe only answer is off-grid. The developers who figured that out are the ones getting projects online this decade.\n\nWhat breaks first — the grid or the AI industry's patience with it?", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2117996786212122860"}, {"author_id": "812424121036505088", "created_at": "2026-11-04T03:39:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117823911480213829"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "sciencedirect.com/science/articl…", "end": 98, "expanded_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0378775322010138", "start": 75, "unwound_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0378775322010138", "url": "https://t.co/QH0wQPea4c"}]}, "id": "2117823911480213829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Assessment of the first commercial Prussian blue based sodium-ion battery\n\nhttps://t.co/QH0wQPea4c", "url": "https://x.c